      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task is to create a Python file named `start_oauth_login.py` that starts an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login using a concrete external provider. I will choose Google as the external provider for this task, as it is a widely used and well-documented OAuth provider. The code will include provider-specific details such as the authorization endpoint, client ID, and scopes to make the integration identifiable. </thinking>\n",
